				<wikidot:authorName>RhettSarlin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>300030</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Decently interesting idea, but not very well executed. The researcher seems to be telling us how we should feel &quot;OOOH IT'S GETTING SPOOKY&quot; kind of thing. It also feels like they know that what they're doing is going to cause them to be in greater danger, yet they proceed with the experiments anyway. This could be re-written in a way that would be genuinely good though. Downvote for now.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
